          <!-- Social proof -->
          <blockquote class="demo-quote reveal" data-delay="2">
            <p class="demo-quote__text">&ldquo;I booked the demo thinking I&rsquo;d spend 20 minutes being sold to. Instead I spent 20 minutes realising exactly what I&rsquo;d been missing. We were live within a week.&rdquo;</p>
